                                                "sense_id": "11715f71-8808-3513-9c32-ec41963fbe01",
                                                "text": "College basketball games don't lack for gambling propositions—the moneyline, a straightforward wager on which team will win; the over-under gamble on the total number of points scored by both teams—but the most popular wager is the spread. The spread represents the predicted difference between the two teams in the final score of the game."
