                                                "sense_id": "832bef9b-def6-3371-85d1-fc0fdfd85829",
                                                "text": "If debate is a game, then the execution of a \"spread\" is like a well-timed blitz in football. Convincing a judge that your opponents' arguments would cause human extinction is equivalent to a successful Hail Mary pass."
